    {t:'combo',d:H,q:'Which statements about ATP synthase are correct? (a) It is Complex V (b) F<sub>0</sub> forms the proton channel (c) F<sub>1</sub> has the ATP synthesis site (d) It is in the outer mitochondrial membrane',o:['(a), (b) and (c) only','(d) only','(a) and (d) only','All four'],e:'It is in the inner membrane.'},
    {t:'seq',d:M,q:'Arrange the path of electrons from NADH:',steps:['A. Complex III (cytochrome bc<sub>1</sub>)','B. Complex I (NADH dehydrogenase)','C. Cytochrome c and Complex IV','D. Ubiquinone'],o:['B-D-A-C','B-A-D-C','D-B-A-C','B-D-C-A'],e:'I &rarr; UQ &rarr; III &rarr; cyt c &rarr; IV &rarr; O<sub>2</sub>.'}
